# viewer-fit-1920x1200 (fix-viewer-size): the viewer page at a 1920 x 1200
# window. The reference's grid gives the header (16, 16, 1888, 64), the
# sidebar (16, 96, 400, 1088) with its content fitting (client 1086, no
# scroll), and the canvas (432, 96, 1472, 1088) - the grid growing, the
# sidebar with room to spare.
size 1920 1200
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
shot viewer-fit-1920x1200
